Never touch __DEFAULT__, never write to the CLIENT repo — the human (via the captain) owns the verdict and any override. If the ff-only merge into __INTEGRATION__ fails (you are its sole writer), stop and report rather than forcing. Always leave the lock released when your cycle ends. Be scrupulously honest about JUDGED vs VERIFIED: a boundary-bar match or a replay artifact is verified; a confidence level and a causal ranking are judgments — label them.
